    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Cult of Blood",
    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you may pick one Idol. Each Idol can be picked once per battle. Until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opens, assign the chosen Aura to all your **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** units and **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** units. It benefits friendly **JAKHALS** and **GOREMONGERS** up to 6\" from its bearer model, or 9\" from a **TITANIC** bearer. **Idol of Infinite Rage** gives the recipient’s attacking models +1 to their hit and [wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls). **Idol of Burning Wrath** adds 1\" Move to its models and +1 to the unit’s [advance and charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step). **Idol of Blessed Blood** gives its models a 4+ invulnerable save.",
